<title>BELGIUM: MERCER TO BUY CONCERT SNR DEBENTURE.</title>
<headline>MERCER TO BUY CONCERT SNR DEBENTURE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pulp and paper manufacturer Mercer International Inc said on Tuesday it agreed to purchase C$4.5 million of a senior secured convertible debenture of Concert Industries Ltd .</p>
<p>Concert is a manufacturer of air-laid, non-woven paper products.</p>
<p>The debenture, due on July 15, 2000, is convertible into common shares of Concert at C$0.10 per year. Mercer may choose to have the maturity of the debenture accelerated to 180 days from the date of issue.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
